    <briefdescription>
<para>Called when an <ref refid="classendstone_1_1Actor" kindref="compound">Actor</ref> is inside a supported block. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Endstone currently fires this event for non-empty water, lava, and powder snow cauldrons.</para>
<para>If this event is cancelled, the block will not affect the <ref refid="classendstone_1_1Actor" kindref="compound">Actor</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
